bnail": {"file_name": "landsacpe.png", "id": "1368326505327967", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_1368326508661300_1627871630264978088_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CRQRisE4mMAQ7kNvwHY0puc&_nc_oc=AdqCIAKN0fx32Mfa9MUpZdV3dl5wrjPI43EF9W5uhJ3I42TMNrbLNeXAimE7eMrnsuM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9jTwwz0cOocFtOO1jlaF84e4V7DddIQ1Y23EpQ4qQ6Tw&oe=6A3170A7"}, "display_name": "I Am Zombie VR", "keywords": ["zombie", "action", "simulator"], "long_description": "I Am Zombie VR is a fast-paced VR action game where you become the zombie.\n\nEnter a dangerous laboratory outbreak and hunt down terrified humans from a first-person perspective. Use your hands to grab, chase, and infect your targets as chaos spreads through a stylized sci-fi lab. Every moment is built for immersive VR gameplay\u2014feel the tension as victims run, panic, and try to escape.\n\nDesigned for accessibility and fun, the game blends cartoon-style visuals with intense action. Easy to pick up, hard to master\u2014perfect for both casual players and VR enthusiasts looking for a unique role reversal experience.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Key Features:\n\nBe the zombie in a true first-person VR experience\nGrab, chase, and infect humans with intuitive controls\nDynamic NPC reactions: fear, panic, and escape behaviors\nStylized laboratory environment with biohazard theme\nFast, replayable arcade gameplay loops\nOptimized for smooth and comfortable VR play\n\nWhether you're looking for a fun VR action game, a unique zombie simulator, or a fresh horror-inspired experience\u2014I Am Zombie VR delivers thrilling gameplay with a playful twist.\n\nInfect. Chase. Dominate.", "short_description": "Become the hunter in I Am Zombie VR. Chase terrified humans through a chaotic lab, infect, grab, and turn them into zombies. Use your hands to interact, hunt, and spread the outbreak in a fast-paced, cartoon-style VR experience full of tension, a